.3,178.8,19,8\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\" mirror-in-rtl=\"true\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" focusable=\"false\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"s1450\" data-r=\"238.3,178.8,8,8\" style=\"fill: rgb(73, 76, 78); stroke-width: 1px; opacity: 1; stroke-linecap: butt; stroke-linejoin: miter; fill-rule: nonzero;\">\n  <path d=\"M5.49 15.61a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-.1-2.12L9.47 9 5.39 4.51a1.5 1.5 0 1 1 2.22-2.02L12.62 8A1.474 1.474 0 0 1 13 9a1.524 1.524 0 0 1-.38 1l-5.01 5.51a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-2.12.1z\" style=\"fill: rgb(73, 76, 78); stroke-width: 1px; opacity: 1; stroke-linecap: butt; stroke-linejoin: miter; fill-rule: nonzero;\"></path>\n</svg>\n</div></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"s31615\" data-el=\"d2l-breadcrumb-current-page\" role=\"listitem\" data-r=\"253,172.3,469.5,21\"><span class=\"s6\" aria-current=\"page\" data-r=\"253,175.7,469.5,14\">AY2026-27 Term 1: e$10 and End-term Course Feedback (Undergraduate)</span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</nav>\n\t\t<span data-pseudo=\"::after\" class=\"s1452\"></span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"s30923\" data-r=\"127.3,203.3,1170,96\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"s31616\" data-r=\"127.3,203.3,1170,96\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"s31617\" data-r=\"127.3,203.3,1170,96\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"s30923\" data-r=\"127.3,203.3,1170,96\"><div class=\"s31616\" data-r=\"127.3,203.3,1170,96\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"s31617\" data-r=\"127.3,203.3,1170,96\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"s26618\" data-r=\"127.3,207.3,1019,88\">AY2026-27 Term 1: e$10 and End-term Course Feedback (Undergraduate)</h1>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"s90\" data-r=\"127.3,299.3,1,0\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"s31618\" data-r=\"127.3,329.3,370,22.4\">Sample Staff posted on Nov 6, 2026 10:00 AM</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"s31619\" data-id=\"d2l_1_2_964\" data-r=\"504.4,329.3,79.2,22.4\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"s31620\" data-id=\"d2l_1_3_65\" alt=\"\" data-r=\"512,329.3,18,18\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" style=\"width:18px;height:18px\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"s31621\" data-r=\"537.6,329.3,40.4,22.4\">Edited</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"s90\" data-r=\"127.3,351.7,1,0\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"s31622\" data-r=\"127.3,351.7,1170,745.8\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"s31623\" data-r=\"127.3,361.2,1170,736.3\"><div class=\"s31624\" data-el=\"d2l-html-block\" data-r=\"117.8,361.2,1179.5,736.3\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"s31625\" data-r=\"127.3,361.2,1170,736.3\"><p class=\"s30641\" data-r=\"127.3,361.2,1170,24.2\"><span class=\"s134\" data-r=\"385.8,363.9,653,18\"><em class=\"s135\" data-r=\"385.8,363.9,653,18\"><span class=\"s136\" data-r=\"385.8,365.2,653,16.7\">&lt;&lt;This message applies only to students enrolled in AY2026-27 Term 1 undergraduate courses&gt;&gt;</span></em></span></p>\n<p class=\"s30642\" data-r=\"127.3,401.4,1170,23.5\"><span class=\"s138\" data-r=\"127.3,404.7,100.6,16.7\">Dear Students,</span></p>\n<p class=\"s31626\" data-r=\"127.3,440.9,1170,48.4\"><span class=\"s134\" data-r=\"127.3,443.6,1165.8,42.2\"><span class=\"s136\" data-r=\"127.3,444.9,408.2,16.7\">The Undergraduate End-term Course Feedback Exercise for </span><strong class=\"s140\" data-r=\"535.5,443.6,127.1,18\"><span class=\"s136\" data-r=\"535.5,444.9,127.1,16.7\">AY2026-27 Term 1</span></strong><span class=\"s136\" data-r=\"662.7,444.9,195.3,16.7\"> has started. You will receive </span><strong class=\"s140\" data-r=\"858,443.6,33.4,18\"><span class=\"s136\" data-r=\"858,444.9,33.4,16.7\">e$10</span></strong><span class=\"s136\" data-r=\"127.3,444.9,1165.8,40.8\"> after you have successfully submitted the feedback for your listed courses. The e$ will be credited to your E-Account 1 week after end-of-term. (Note: e$ does not apply to exchange students)</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"s30643\" data-r=\"127.3,505.3,1170,72.5\"><span class=\"s134\" data-r=\"127.3,507.9,741.4,66.4\"><strong class=\"s140\" data-r=\"127.3,507.9,181.5,18\"><span class=\"s136\" data-r=\"127.3,509.3,181.5,16.7\">Course Feedback Period:</span></strong><b class=\"s140\" data-r=\"308.8,507.9,0,18\"><span class=\"s136\" data-r=\"308.8,509.3,0,16.7\"><br class=\"s6\" data-r=\"308.8,509.3,0,16.7\"></span></b><span class=\"s136\" data-r=\"127.3,533.4,301.3,16.7\">You can submit your responses from <b class=\"s140\" data-r=\"375.9,533.4,52.7,16.7\">Friday, </b></span><strong class=\"s140\" data-r=\"428.6,532.1,416.5,18\"><span class=\"s136\" data-r=\"428.6,533.4,416.5,16.7\">6 November (10.00am) to Sunday, 22 November (11.59pm) </span></strong><span class=\"s136\" data-r=\"845.1,533.4,23.6,16.7\">via </span><strong class=\"s140\" data-r=\"868.7,532.1,0,18\"><span class=\"s136\" data-r=\"868.7,533.4,0,16.7\"> </span></strong><a class=\"s141\" data-href=\"https://feedback.example.edu/student\" data-r=\"127.3,556.3,435.1,18\"><span class=\"s136\" data-r=\"127.3,557.6,435.1,16.7\">https://feedback.example.edu/student</span></a><span class=\"s136\" data-r=\"562.5,557.6,4.3,16.7\">.</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"s30642\" data-r=\"127.3,593.8,1170,23.5\"><span class=\"s138\" data-r=\"127.3,597.1,940,16.7\">If you encounter technical difficulties, please clear your browser cache and try again, or access the link using Firefox Private/Incognito mode.</span></p>\n<p class=\"s30644\" data-r=\"127.3,633.3,1170,47\"><span class=\"s138\" data-r=\"127.3,636.6,1157.5,40.2\">Some University-XO, Study Mission, and Work-Study Elective courses show a \"pending\" status as they have a different feedback period and you will be notified of the dates in due course. The crediting of e$ will not be affected by such courses.</span></p>\n<p class=\"s31627\" data-r=\"127.3,696.3,1170,96.7\"><span class=\"s134\" data-r=\"127.3,699,1136.4,90.5\"><strong class=\"s140\" data-r=\"127.3,699,65.2,18\"><span class=\"s136\" data-r=\"127.3,700.3,65.2,16.7\">Purpose:</span></strong><b class=\"s140\" data-r=\"192.5,699,0,18\"><span class=\"s136\" data-r=\"192.5,700.3,0,16.7\"><br class=\"s6\" data-r=\"192.5,700.3,0,16.7\"></span></b><span class=\"s136\" data-r=\"127.3,724.5,1136.4,65\">Your input is important in helping your instructors identify their strengths and areas for improvement. The information will be provided to University administrators as an input for teaching evaluations, promotions, salary adjustments, contract renewal decisions for the instructor, and curriculum improvement.  The data may also be processed by approved AI tools to track the overall teaching effectiveness and trends at University.</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"s31627\" data-r=\"127.3,809,1170,96.7\"><span class=\"s134\" data-r=\"127.3,811.7,1167.3,90.5\"><strong class=\"s140\" data-r=\"127.3,811.7,82.7,18\"><span class=\"s136\" data-r=\"127.3,813,82.7,16.7\">Anonymity:</span></strong><b class=\"s140\" data-r=\"210,811.7,0,18\"><span class=\"s136\" data-r=\"210,813,0,16.7\"><br class=\"s6\" data-r=\"210,813,0,16.7\"></span></b><span class=\"s136\" data-r=\"127.3,837.2,1167.3,65\">In the interest of preserving anonymity, you are reminded not to state your name anywhere on the survey, or provide any comments that could disclose your identity. While responses are treated confidentially, you are reminded to exercise this privilege responsibly in your feedback. Any writing amounting to harassment or threat on any person will be subjected to university inquiry.</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"s31626\" data-r=\"127.3,921.8,1170,48.4\"><span class=\"s134\" data-r=\"127.3,924.4,832.3,42.2\"><strong class=\"s140\" data-r=\"127.3,924.4,215.1,18\"><span class=\"s136\" data-r=\"127.3,925.8,215.1,16.7\">Release of Feedback Reports:</span></strong><b class=\"s140\" data-r=\"342.4,924.4,0,18\"><span class=\"s136\" data-r=\"342.4,925.8,0,16.7\"><br class=\"s6\" data-r=\"342.4,925.8,0,16.7\"></span></b><span class=\"s136\" data-r=\"127.3,949.9,832.3,16.7\">The feedback report will only be released to instructors after students’ grades are officially released by the Registrar’s Office.</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"s31626\" data-r=\"127.3,986.1,1170,48.4\"><span class=\"s134\" data-r=\"127.3,988.8,1105.4,42.2\"><span class=\"s136\" data-r=\"127.3,990.1,372.3,16.7\">For questions on e$, please contact the Registry Team at </span><a class=\"s141\" data-href=\"mailto:bstudent@example.com\" data-r=\"499.7,988.8,162.4,18\"><span class=\"s136\" data-r=\"499.7,990.1,162.4,16.7\">student@example.com</span></a><span class=\"s136\" data-r=\"127.3,990.1,1105.4,40.8\">. For questions about the Course Feedback Exercise, contact the Teaching Excellence Centre at </span><a class=\"s141\" data-href=\"mailto:cstudent@example.com\" data-r=\"221.4,1012.9,161.6,18\"><span class=\"s136\" data-r=\"221.4,1014.3,161.6,16.7\">student@example.com</span></a><span class=\"s136\" data-r=\"383,1014.3,224.4,16.7\">. Thank you for your participation.</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"s30647\" data-r=\"127.3,1050.5,1170,47\"><span class=\"s138\" data-r=\"127.3,1053.8,208.7,40.2\">Best regards,<br class=\"s6\" data-r=\"217.2,1053.8,0,16.7\">Teaching Excellence Centre</span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div></div></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n<div class=\"s31995\" data-id=\"lw-chat-wrapper\" aria-label=\"Message Aiden\" role=\"dialog\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-r=\"35,1160,1330,855\"><div class=\"s512\" data-id=\"lw-chat-wrapper-top-resize\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-r=\"46.4,1160,1307.2,11.4\"></div><div class=\"s513\" data-id=\"lw-chat-wrapper-bottom-resize\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-r=\"46.4,2003.6,1307.2,11.4\"></div><div class=\"s514\" data-id=\"lw-chat-wrapper-left-resize\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-r=\"35,1171.4,11.4,832.2\"><